{"id":47341,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-valencia-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-10-28T09:36:07","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T08:36:07","slug":"maratona-de-valencia","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-valencia\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Val\u00eancia 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Val\u00eancia 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Maratona de Val\u00eancia 2026<\/strong> (46\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da *Marat\u00f3n Valencia Trinidad Alfonso Zurich*) realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">6 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, na cidade de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Val\u00eancia, Espanha<\/strong>. Com partida por vagas sucessivas a partir das <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">08:15<\/strong> na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pla\u00e7a de Monteolivete<\/strong> e a ic\u00f3nica meta instalada na passadeira azul sobre a \u00e1gua da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Cidade das Artes e das Ci\u00eancias<\/strong> (*Ciutat de les Arts i les Ci\u00e8ncies*), esta prova det\u00e9m o cobi\u00e7ado <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Platinum Label da World Athletics<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Reconhecida mundialmente como uma das maratonas mais r\u00e1pidas do planeta para bater recordes pessoais nos <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">42,195 km<\/strong>, o seu tra\u00e7ado 100% urbano e plano ao n\u00edvel do mar (homologado pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">AIMS<\/strong> e <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">RFEA<\/strong>) percorre as grandes avenidas valencianas, o entorno dos <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Jardins do T\u00faria<\/strong>, a fachada mar\u00edtima da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Malvarrosa<\/strong> e o centro hist\u00f3rico de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Val\u00eancia<\/strong>, beneficiando de temperaturas amenas de in\u00edcio de dezembro.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">SD Correcaminos<\/strong> e pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ayuntamiento de Val\u00e8ncia<\/strong> (Fundaci\u00f3n Deportiva Municipal), a prova re\u00fane um pelot\u00e3o de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">36.000 maratonistas<\/strong> (com forte presen\u00e7a de atletas portugueses), oferecendo organiza\u00e7\u00e3o de topo em <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">9 vagas de partida<\/strong>, *Expo 42K* na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Feria Valencia<\/strong>, camisola t\u00e9cnica oficial e um tempo limite regulamentar de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">5 horas e 30 minutos<\/strong>. Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pla\u00e7a de Monteolivete \/ Cidade das Artes e das Ci\u00eancias, Val\u00eancia, Espanha<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42,195 km (Maratona Platinum Label World Athletics)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">SD Correcaminos e Ayuntamiento de Val\u00e8ncia<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.valenciaciudaddelrunning.com\/en\/marathon\/regulations-valencia-marathon\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Maratona de Val\u00eancia Trinidad Alfonso Zurich (42,195 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 08:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00ba Tramo (Dorsais 1 a 10.000):<\/strong> 80,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotado (+5\u20ac Licen\u00e7a Dia))<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00ba Tramo \/ Ballot (10.001 a 36.000):<\/strong> 180,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Esgotado (+5\u20ac Licen\u00e7a Dia))<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lista de Espera Oficial:<\/strong> 200,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Vagas de desist\u00eancia (+5\u20ac Licen\u00e7a))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a Maratona de Val\u00eancia 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 46\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Maratona de Val\u00eancia Trinidad Alfonso Zurich realiza-se no domingo, 6 de dezembro de 2026. As partidas decorrem em 9 vagas (waves) de acordo com o tempo acreditado de cada atleta, come\u00e7ando \u00e0s 08:15 na Pla\u00e7a de Monteolivete.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) para concluir os 42,195 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo m\u00e1ximo oficial para concluir a maratona \u00e9 de 5 horas e 30 minutos ap\u00f3s cruzar a linha de partida, encerrando o circuito definitivamente \u00e0s 15:15 na Cidade das Artes e das Ci\u00eancias.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova tem capacidade m\u00e1xima para 36.000 corredores, distribu\u00eddos por: 1\u00ba tramo (dorsais 1 a 10.000) a 80,00 \u20ac, 2\u00ba tramo e sorteio Ballot (dorsais 10.001 a 36.000) a 180,00 \u20ac, e Lista de Espera Oficial (para vagas de desist\u00eancia) a 200,00 \u20ac. A estes valores acresce a Licen\u00e7a de Dia obrigat\u00f3ria da RFEA de 5,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento do dorsal na Expo 42K?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O dorsal com chip e o saco do corredor s\u00e3o entregues exclusivamente na feira Expo 42K Feria Valencia na sexta-feira, 4 de dezembro, e no s\u00e1bado, 5 de dezembro de 2026, das 09:00 \u00e0s 21:00. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no domingo, dia da corrida.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as caixas de partida e a mudan\u00e7a de titularidade?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A atribui\u00e7\u00e3o da vaga e caixa de partida \u00e9 feita mediante valida\u00e7\u00e3o do melhor tempo obtido nos \u00faltimos 3 anos (em 10K, 15K, Meia Maratona ou Maratona homologada). A plataforma oficial permite tamb\u00e9m solicitar a mudan\u00e7a legal de titular do dorsal atrav\u00e9s da \u00e1rea privada do corredor.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Val\u00eancia 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-06\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-06\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Val\u00eancia, Espanha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Espanha\", \"addressRegion\": \"Espanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"description\": \"A 46\u00aa Maratona de Val\u00eancia 2026 realiza-se a 6 de dezembro em Espanha. Percurso r\u00e1pido de 42,195 km na Cidade das Artes e das Ci\u00eancias, hor\u00e1rios e dorsais!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-maratona-de-valencia.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Val\u00eancia Trinidad Alfonso Zurich (42,195 km)\", \"price\": \"80.00\", \"p